================================================================================
4. RESPONSIBLE & LAWFUL USE
================================================================================
Signal Atlas is designed as a RECEIVE-ONLY system. Any authorized use must:
  (a) operate receive-only and never transmit;
  (b) decode only device-identifying / control-plane metadata for device
      determination, and never intercept, decrypt, or divulge the CONTENTS of
      communications;
  (c) comply with all applicable laws and regulations governing radio reception,
      privacy, and communications interception in the operator's jurisdiction
      (e.g., in the United States, the Wiretap Act 18 U.S.C. § 2511 and the
      Communications Act § 605), which vary by jurisdiction.
The Owner does not authorize, and disclaims all responsibility for, any unlawful
or unauthorized use. Compliance is the sole responsibility of the operator.

